      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEER CHEER (4) is long overdue for a win, finishing in the minors at his last three starts, the latest jumping from this same box when second in a Maiden at Sale (25.03). Looks the one to beat on best. CRACKED ICE (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish a neck away in second (16.90) behind Just Thirty Days at Healesville. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Expected to feature. ASTON PATTEN (2) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Sandown behind Godzilla (30.69) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Leading player again. DIRTY NALA (3) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - in the mix again.",
